{"about_the_game":"You thought neon lights, big hairdos and piles of snow were a thing of the past? Think again and get ready to go crazy in a world full of quirky characters, weird gadgets and above all fast-paced retro-aesthetic action! Scoop up some snowballs, take aim and fire at will!<br><br>Snow War is an FPS (First Person Snowball) Game! No blood is shed, but that does not mean the stakes are not real.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/5a827e94e8aa43232ab5efdba8b3cb87.poster.avif?t=1731246708\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/5a827e94e8aa43232ab5efdba8b3cb87.webm?t=1731246708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/5a827e94e8aa43232ab5efdba8b3cb87.mp4?t=1731246708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Find Power-Ups that protect you from your enemies or give you a game winning edge!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/db4bd3d539fc64c7c8e4e3f6d8097052.poster.avif?t=1731246708\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/db4bd3d539fc64c7c8e4e3f6d8097052.webm?t=1731246708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/db4bd3d539fc64c7c8e4e3f6d8097052.mp4?t=1731246708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Arm your self with <i>The Snowbow</i> and other gadgets. They might be held together with gum and duct tape, but you will still be virtuall unstoppable! But beware: batteries run out eventually!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/f71d6a87be90e288f885fd9d28c1c7fd.poster.avif?t=1731246708\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/f71d6a87be90e288f885fd9d28c1c7fd.webm?t=1731246708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/f71d6a87be90e288f885fd9d28c1c7fd.mp4?t=1731246708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>So what are you waiting for? Find your way in the blinding lights of the cities and lush pine forests, grab some power-ups to wreak havoc among your enemies and climb the scoreboard to earn your place as the undisputed champion of the snowfields!<br><br>Key features:<br>- Classic PvP FPS (First Person Snowball) action with up to 16 players<br>- Free-for-all and different Team fight modes<br>- Play Online or LAN<br>- Play offline against Bots<br>- Variety of different Power-Ups that alter the game<br>- Create a Custom server where you set the rules","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1585100?t=1731246708","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1585100?t=1731246708","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1731246708","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1731246708","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"You thought neon lights, big hairdos and piles of snow were a thing of